actions, cap-bounded reservation, queue without proof, no sweep).
Dispositions:

- **Set null changes another rule's verdict** (GPT 1, Muse 1): accepted,
  strengthened beyond both — a set-null column may carry no authority in any
  rule of any table, nor sync, horizon, recorded or maintained paths (§2.2).
