invalidate the witnessed rows; jobs remain exempt. Proved unreachable branches are discarded under the preceding path facts.
Unknown or oversized branch products stay quiet, with overflow propagated
through the complete expression. The advisory never changes admission or runtime.

The guide recipes cover a transactionally maintained mutable audience copy,
implies its actual read rule. Unknown policy components contribute no
assumption; unknown positive child branches cannot help prove the goal.
The proof accounts for both conditional paths, requirements and early
returns. Rebinding, loops, expression blocks, pair-return sinks, mutation
bodies, copied audience conventions, read-through, maintenance, field owners,
lifetimes and synced outer tables do not establish this proof. A probe may
be witnessed only by the exact captured table/index/key and required field
values. Nullable Boolean false is never inferred from not-true. The setup of a lowered short-circuit temporary confers no completed-condition
facts. Nullable snapshot ids stay null in path comparisons; a positive
exact-key witness may equate its own id only together with its presence.
Interpreter-owned `$filter`/`$project` bindings confer no snapshot evidence.
Fresh-id evaluations, reads and builtins are not symbolic comparison
identities. A reconstructed short circuit may reference only once-bound
values; a reference to its own prior value or any other assigned temporary
declines this proof. Inconsistent path facts grant no trusted scan: the
